# 101 - Verify Server Startup

**Phase:** 1 (Foundation)
**Effect:** Server compiles, starts, and accepts connections
**Status:** In Progress (compilation working, verification pending)

---

## The Effect

AzerothCore compiles from source with all modules (ALE, playerbots, AoE loot, grownup). The authserver and worldserver start without crashing. Configuration points to project-local paths and MySQL instance.

This is the foundation—without a running server, there's no game.

